{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "宿", "id": "宿"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "殺", "id": "殺"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "美", "id": "美"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.784189633918261, "source": "行", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.531426665422893, "source": "行", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.6855773452501515, "source": "行", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.4519851237430572, "source": "行", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.9368917735310576, "source": "事", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 3.091042453358316, "source": "事", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.6343066805370119, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.010152371464017908, "source": "人", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.1451323043030026, "source": "人", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.2978344439157989, "source": "人", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.1451323043030026, "source": "人", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.243744592971112, "source": "人", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 2.243744592971112, "source": "人", "target": "殺"}, {"weight": 2.803360380906535, "source": "宿", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.550597412411167, "source": "宿", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.1451323043030026, "source": "後", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 0.6343066805370119, "source": "仁", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 3.2733640101522705, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.0206010416569025, "source": "仁